{"text":"Six, go for it and always allow failure to be an option. True freedom is being without anxiety about imperfection, says Zen Master Tseng Tsang. And right now, I am learning to deeply value my human right to be imperfect. No matter who we are or what stage of achievement we are at, I think that it is healthy to always have some perfection to work towards. It gives us perspective and also gives us something worth living another day for. Six, the seven, finally, step forward and repeat it all. With each step you take, with each new challenge you face, expect yourself to learn these lessons again and again. Do not be disappointed in yourself when it feels like this time it is harder or different. It will always be harder or different if you are growing. When you feel overwhelmed by this, remind yourself that you feel despair because you still care.","words":[{"text":"Six","start":0.0,"end":1.3,"punct":","},{"text":"go","start":2.46,"end":2.8},{"text":"for","start":2.8,"end":3.16},{"text":"it","start":3.16,"end":3.42},{"text":"and","start":3.42,"end":3.9},{"text":"always","start":3.9,"end":4.5},{"text":"allow","start":4.5,"end":4.92},{"text":"failure","start":4.92,"end":5.36},{"text":"to","start":5.36,"end":5.56},{"text":"be","start":5.56,"end":5.72},{"text":"an","start":5.72,"end":5.84},{"text":"option","start":5.84,"end":6.22,"punct":"."},{"text":"True","start":7.38,"end":7.5},{"text":"freedom","start":7.5,"end":7.96},{"text":"is","start":7.96,"end":8.38},{"text":"being","start":8.38,"end":8.88},{"text":"without","start":8.88,"end":10.18},{"text":"anxiety","start":10.18,"end":10.86},{"text":"about","start":10.86,"end":11.28},{"text":"imperfection","start":11.28,"end":12.0,"punct":","},{"text":"says","start":12.72,"end":13.08},{"text":"Zen","start":13.08,"end":13.44},{"text":"Master","start":13.44,"end":13.8},{"text":"Tseng","start":13.8,"end":14.14},{"text":"Tsang","start":14.14,"end":14.5,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":15.4,"end":15.78},{"text":"right","s